# S60: e1m8's Shambler, woken at film second 2.2; the player stands facing it, god mode,
# slop with the status bar and the gun; the camera stands 24 units behind the eye and 24
# above it ("Then played it, and said what was wrong"). On its patrol it comes close,
# claws, then casts its lightning. The window, frames 53 to 430, puts the first bolt at
# its 3.2 s. Brightness 0.7.

map e1m8
warmup 0.1
wake 608,-424,280 at 2.2

duration 9
fps 60
size 1920x1080
frames 53..431

preset slop
hud on
gun on
player 608,-620,280,90
cvar gamma 0.7

camera fixed 608,-644,326 6,90

sound on
events on
